      "scope": "All displayed declarations, instructions, main methods and exception tables; no archived program execution.",
      "observation": "Recognizes exact lowercase endings .clog2/.clog/.rlog/.ute/.slog/.slog2/.txt, otherwise empty extension. getDefaultSLOG2Name directly replaces .clog2/.clog/.rlog/.txt without sanitizing. Other suffixes go through stripInvalidChar and append .slog2, omitting extra dot if final dot already present. Tokenizer delimiter runs collapse to underscore; delimiter set differs with file.separator, retaining native separator. Leading hyphen gets TRACE_ prefix. stripInvalidChar calls charAt(0) before checking length, so empty/all-delimiter input reaches that access before caller fallback trace.slog2. No file I/O or null guard. Existing .slog2 takes fallback and receives another suffix."
